  "details": "As there are many Cannys, we can't wait for adding List<T> support.\nI found List<T> support is on roadmap but It have been one year.\nI think one reason why it's delayed is generic support is hard.\nSo, I want UdonVM to have non-generic (traditional) collection support instead of generics as alternative until generic collection.\n(and I want language compilers such as U# have List<T> emulation via ArrayList)\nI think adding non-generic collections (such as ArrayList, Hashtable) support is easier than generic ones because those classes are simple non-generic class.\nroadmap: https://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-april-2021-dev-stream-recap-8502bb8c9163\ncannyes to add generic collection:\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/expose-c-generic-collections-listt-dictionarytkeytvalue-etc\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/request-add-list-type-handling\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/add-major-c-collection-types",
